  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Engram</strong></p><p><strong>Farsight: Spend a Hope</strong> to project your senses at a point within Very Far range. You can see from this point as though you're looking out from its position until the scene ends or you dismiss the effect.</p><p><strong>Reveal Weakness:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to make them temporarily <em>Vulnerable</em>.</p><p><strong>Telekinesis: Spend a Hope</strong> to exert telekinetic force on an object within Far range, allowing you to lift, move, or manipulate it with the same size and strength as your own body. This effect lasts until the end of the scene. You can make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range of you. On a success, throw the object at them and deal <strong>d8 + your Power Trait</strong> kinetic damage. Then the effect ends.</p>",
